abstract: >
  This repository contains the experimental code accompanying
  the manuscript "Simulated Variational Quantum Circuits for
  Hybrid Scientific Document Re-ranking". The study evaluates
  simulated variational quantum circuits for second-stage
  document re-ranking within a hybrid retrieval framework.
  The second-round revision includes classical MLP-BCE and
  MLP-Hinge comparisons, exploratory evaluation on SciFact,
  independent cross-domain evaluation on NFCorpus, statistical
  analysis and computational latency benchmarking.
  The complete reproducibility package is available on Zenodo.

